ins. She has also vastly out-raised Williams, holding a cash advantage of more than $2 million.\n\nEvery major race rater scores the seat as Likely Democratic or better, and prediction markets price Goodlander's win odds above 90 percent. Williams has proven she can run a lean, competitive campaign, but the combination of incumbency, money, and polling strength makes an upset unlikely.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9818, "margin": 13.85}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9772, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.978, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9829, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9791, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9795, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9872, "margin": 15.0}]}